1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,400
Remember rewinding a cassette with a pencil?

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,500
So, how many turns does it really take?

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,100
A C ninety tape plays forty-five minutes per side.

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:14,300
At four point seven six centimeters a second, that's about one hundred twenty-eight meters of tape.

5
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:17,000
One pencil turn winds about eleven centimeters.

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:20,300
One hundred twenty-eight meters, divided by eleven centimeters...

7
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,500
About eleven hundred seventy turns!

8
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:27,900
At two turns a second, almost ten minutes. For one song.

